# @hub-lanes

# ── HUB-PROBE LANE (BH-3434) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 min: claim up to HUB_PROBE_TICK_CAP hub-probe requests, run each
# probe on the hub, store the result and post one marked comment on the ticket.
# One summary line per tick in logs/hub-probe.log. flock -n dedupes; a held lock
# skips the tick. Off: the hub-probe-off switch, flags/lane-off-hub-probe, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off hub-probe.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/hub-probe.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
